/* 10 标签选择器（界面风格规范 v1：56px 圆，内边距 8px；选中米色底+红字；白事深灰无红） */
.tag-grid {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  padding: 14px 14px 4px;
}
.tagcell {
  width: 20%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 10px 0;
}
.tagcircle {
  width: 56px;
  height: 56px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #F5F6F4;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.tagcircle.active { background: #F1E6D3; }
.tagcircle.active-baishi { background: #E8EAED; }
.tagimg { width: 40px; height: 40px; }
.tagname {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #666;
  margin-top: 6px;
}
.tagname.name-active { color: #E05353; font-weight: 700; }
.tagname.name-baishi { color: #3B4046; font-weight: 700; }
